  "summary": "The identified studies apply representation learning with paired positive and negative examples to the task of estimating agricultural yield. Brennan et al. [V0048] report an F1 score of 0.83 on the ToxiBench dataset. Gupta et al. [V0045] utilize the AgriSat-4 dataset, achieving an accuracy of 0.62. Haddad et al. [V0046] evaluate the method on LedgerGuard, reporting a test MAE of 0.69. Adebayo et al. [V0047] achieve an AUROC of 0.76 using the CellLife dataset. Additionally, Adebayo et al. [V0239] apply the method to predicting road traffic flow using AgriSat-4, reporting an AUROC of 0.72.",
